        "contentType": "raw",
        "body": "={\n  \"model\": \"llama-3.1-8b-instant\",\n  \"temperature\": 0,\n  \"response_format\": {\n    \"type\": \"json_object\"\n  },\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"You are a backend entity-extraction API. Read unstructured email text, identify scheduling requests, and return the data strictly as a parsed JSON object. Do not output markdown, filler, or explanations.\\n\\nCRITICAL CONTEXT:\\nThe current date and time is: {{$now}} (Timezone: IST). Use this to calculate relative dates.\\n\\nEXTRACTION RULES:\\n1. Identify if the email contains a request for a meeting.\\n2. Extract the 'topic' in 5 words or less.\\n3. Extract the 'date' in strictly YYYY-MM-DD format.\\n4. Extract the 'startTime' in 24-hour HH:MM format.\\n5. Extract or calculate the 'endTime' in 24-hour HH:MM format. Default to 30-min duration if none specified.\\n6. If no valid request, set 'isMeeting' to false and others null.\\n\\nREQUIRED JSON SCHEMA:\\n{\\n  \\\"isMeeting\\\": boolean,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n  \\\"date\\\": \\\"YYYY-MM-DD\\\",\\n  \\\"startTime\\\": \\\"HH:MM\\\",\\n  \\\"endTime\\\": \\\"HH:MM\\\"\\n}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Subject: Sync tomorrow\\nBody: Hey Sumang, can we schedule a technical sync regarding the backend architecture tomorrow at 3:00 PM?\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
